l of the wet ingredients in another.\n\n​\n\nAdd the wet ingredients to the dry ingredients and stir just enough to moisten the dry ingredients. A few dry spots are fine.\n\n​\n\nNow add the chopped apples and just barely stir them to incorporate them into the batter.\n\n​\n\nFill the cups of a large muffin pan (6 jumbo muffins) with paper liners sprayed with oil, then fill the paper liners completely full with the muffin batter.\n\n​\n\nBake in a preheated oven at 400 degrees for 40-45 minutes then remove them immediately to cool. You can tell they are done when a toothpick inserted into the center is clean when removed.\n\n \n\nLet them cool at least 20 minutes before serving.","title":"Jumbo Apple Granola Sourdough Breakfast Muffins"},{"introduction":"This is a fresh, cool and creamy dish I happened to be enjoying on a warm July morning for breakfast but I would certainly serve this as an appetizer course or side dish anytime!","servings":"1","photo":"wix:image://v1/577c92_9c68c22ab0b54e7bb9c421d939e0bb4f~mv2_d_4032_3024_s_4_2.jpg/20180611_090955.jpg#originWidth=4032&originHeight=3024","link-recipes-1-title":"/bread-and-sourdough/radish-ricotta-toast-with-fresh-snap-peas-and-lemon-zest","url":"https://www.theglasspantry.com/radish-ricotta-toast","_id":"7bafb9f0-d531-4b5a-87b7-4930d5a5f337","_owner":"577c92d8-55f7-4f98-88a2-d8647b1c2c9c","_createdDate":{"$date":"2023-02-17T18:37:31.243Z"},"title1":"Radish Ricotta Toast with Fresh Snap Peas and Lemon Zest","shortDescription":"Such a simple recipe. Classic and delicious!\n\nToasted the bread, spread thickly with ricotta cheese then top with sliced radishes and snap peas. Sprinkle with lemon zest, sea salt and pink peppercorns then drizzle with the olive oil.","link-recipes-1-all":"/recipes-1/","cookingTime":"2 minutes","_updatedDate":{"$date":"2023-02-17T23:22:03.623Z"},"recipesCatagoryCatagory":"/Recipes/catagory/Bread","preparationTime":"10 min","ingredients":{"nodes":[{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"foo","nodes":[{"typ