urdough Breakfast Muffins"},{"introduction":"This large hearty loaf has great complex flavor. Lightly sweet and nutty with just enough tang from the sourdough to keep it really interesting. It's also very versatile. We like to start by using as a side at dinner but the next day or two we use it up making toast or sandwiches. ","servings":"10-12","photo":"image://v1/577c92_7854605faef44db0a3df48495985b5c8~mv2.jpg/1500_1125/20171207_145439_edited.jpg","link-recipes-1-title":"/bread-and-sourdough/whole-wheat-sourdough-rye-bread","url":"http://www.theglasspantry.com/single-post/2018/04/12/Whole-Wheat-Sourdough-Rye-Bread","image":"wix:image://v1/577c92_23b6c20032ba4e1381b1f354c40ffea0~mv2.jpg/20171207_140511_edited.jpg#originWidth=1500&originHeight=1125","_id":"e21425a3-beae-4967-ab7f-d88dd6410785","_owner":"577c92d8-55f7-4f98-88a2-d8647b1c2c9c","_createdDate":{"$date":"2023-02-17T18:37:31.252Z"},"title1":"Whole Wheat Sourdough Rye Bread","shortDescription":"This large hearty loaf has great complex flavor. Lightly sweet and nutty with just enough tang from the sourdough to keep it really interesting. It's also very versatile. We like to start by using as a side at dinner but the next day or two we use it up making toast or sandwiches. ","link-recipes-1-all":"/recipes-1/","cookingTime":"40 minutes","_updatedDate":{"$date":"2023-02-17T19:53:07.054Z"},"recipesCatagoryCatagory":"/Recipes/catagory/Bread","preparationTime":"3 hours","ingredients":{"nodes":[{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"foo","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"2 1/2 cups all purpose Flour","decorations":[{"type":"COLOR","colorData":{"background":"var(--ricos-custom-p-background-color,unset)","foreground":""}}]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0.0}},{"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"}},"style":{},"id":"1mgst962","nodes":[],"type":"PARAGRAPH"},{"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"}},"style":{},"id":"viewer-eslso","node